msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hm...... This is a video rental＿membership card.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Hm...... Es una tarjeta de＿socio de un videoclub.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「E-Excuse me, did you drop this?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「D-Disculpe, ¿se le cayó esto?」"

msgid "???「......」"
msgstr "???「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Didn't she hear me......? Excuse me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No me escuchó......? ¡Disculpe!」"

msgid "???「......」"
msgstr "???「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Gah, she keeps dropping stuff. Jeez......＿Her name is...... Koigakubo Yuri.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Gah, se le caen cosas. Cielos......＿Se llama...... Koigakubo Yuri.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......K-Koigakubo-san!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡K-Koigakubo-san!」"

msgid "Yuri「......*Gasp*! Huh? W-What? ......My, if it＿isn't Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......¡Ah! ¿Eh? ¿Q-Qué? ......Vaya,＿pero si es Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the一 she knows me?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué rayos一 me conoce?）」"

msgid "Yuri「I was wondering who was calling my＿name.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Me preguntaba quién me estaba llamando.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, er, I'm sorry...... no, forget that!＿You've been dropping stuff left and＿right, you know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ehm, lo siento...... ¡no, olvide＿eso! Se le vienen cayendo cosas＿por todos lados, ¿sabe?」"

msgid "Yuri「Oh, aaah! My goodness...... I'm sorry, I＿was a little zoned out.」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Oh, aaah! Dios mío...... Lo siento,＿estaba un poco distraída.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Zoned out......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Distraída......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Say what you like, but you were more＿than a little zoned out......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Diga lo que quiera, pero estaba mucho＿más que un poco distraída......）」"

msgid "Yuri「Uhh, nothing, it's nothing......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ehh, nada, no es nada......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It doesn't look like nothing. Are you＿really okay?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No parece que no sea nada.＿¿De verdad está bien?」"

msgid "Yuri「......L-Listen to this, Takasu-kunnn!」"
msgstr "Yuri「......¡E-Escucha esto, Takasu-kunnn!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-Yes?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿S-Sí?」"

msgid "Yuri「Remember \"The Single Woman's Guide＿to Purchasing Real Estate\" workshop?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¿Recuerdas el taller \"Guía de compra de＿inmuebles para mujeres solteras\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ummm......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Umm, I'm sorry, you lost me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Emm, lo siento, me perdí.」"

msgid "Yuri「Oh...... Sorry about that, I launched into＿a tangent there.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ah...... Perdón por eso,＿me fui por las ramas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Yuri「She was gushing about how she's＿getting married to one of the real＿estate agents from the workshop!」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Me contó súper emocionada que se＿va a casar con uno de los agentes＿inmobiliarios del taller!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Whoa......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Guau......」"

msgid "Yuri「Isn't she basically graduating from＿single life? What was the point in her＿taking the workshop, then?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¿Acaso no se está graduando de la＿soltería? ¿Entonces qué sentido＿tenía que tomara el taller?」"

msgid "Yuri「But I didn't see it! He was aiming right＿at me, but I never noticed! But the girl＿next to me did!」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Pero yo no lo vi! ¡Él iba directo＿por mí, pero nunca me di cuenta! ¡Pero＿la chica de al lado sí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「C-Calm down! Please calm down!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡C-Cálmese! ¡Por favor, cálmese!」"

msgid "Yuri「*Sigh*...... I, I'm sorry for getting upset.」"
msgstr "Yuri「*Suspiro*...... P-Perdón por alterarme.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-It's fine......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... Bueno......」"

msgid "Yuri「No, it's fine. Don't say anything. I＿understand. I get it.」"
msgstr "Yuri「No, está bien. No digas nada.＿Lo entiendo. Ya lo sé.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Well...... At least, please pay attention＿when you drop something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bueno...... Al menos, por favor preste＿atención cuando se le caiga algo.」"

msgid "Yuri「T-Thank you...... I'll be going,＿Takasu-kun. Happy New Year.」"
msgstr "Yuri「G-Gracias...... Ya me voy, Takasu-kun.＿Feliz Año Nuevo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay. Happy New Year.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien. Feliz Año Nuevo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Is she really alright......? Wait, who＿exactly is she? A neighbor or＿something......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿De verdad estará bien......? Espera,＿¿quién es ella exactamente? ¿Una vecina＿o algo así......?）」"

msgid "Yuri「On Christmas Eve, while you guys were＿reveling in your youth at the party, I＿went to this special workshop for」"
msgstr "Yuri「En Nochebuena, mientras ustedes＿disfrutaban de su juventud en la fiesta,＿yo fui a este taller especial para」"

msgid "Yuri「single women.」"
msgstr "Yuri「mujeres solteras.」"

msgid "Yuri「The entrance fee was 1500 yen......」"
msgstr "Yuri「La entrada costaba 1500 yenes......」"

msgid "Yuri「It was so fantastic. They explained how＿to find property information, applying＿for loans, financing, all that stuff.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Fue fantástico. Explicaron cómo buscar＿información de propiedades, solicitar＿préstamos, financiamiento y todo eso.」"

msgid "Yuri「It was packed full of useful content.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Estaba lleno de contenido muy útil.」"

msgid "Yuri「At the workshop, I happened to sit＿next to someone from my hometown.」"
msgstr "Yuri「En el taller, por casualidad me senté＿junto a alguien de mi ciudad natal.」"

msgid "Yuri「So we exchanged phone numbers......＿Just now, I got a text from her......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Intercambiamos números...... Acabo＿de recibir un mensaje suyo......」"

msgid "Yuri「When I thought more about it, I＿remembered there was this overly＿friendly employee at the workshop......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Al pensarlo mejor, recordé que＿había un empleado demasiado amable＿en el taller......」"

msgid "Yuri「I remember talking to him briefly......＿but for them to get married just like＿that......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Recuerdo haber hablado un poco con＿él...... pero que ellos se vayan＿a casar así como así......」"

msgid "Yuri「A man's a man, you know. At a＿workshop full of women desperate＿enough to show up on Christmas Eve,」"
msgstr "Yuri「Un hombre es un hombre, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Yuri「it's like shooting fish in a barrel!」"
msgstr "Yuri「En un taller lleno de mujeres tan＿desesperadas como para ir en Nochebuena,＿¡son presa fácil!」"

msgid "Yuri「......That text was all I could think＿about...... She chucked 1500 yen in the＿gutter and jumped at the chance to」"
msgstr "Yuri「......Solo pensaba en ese mensaje......」"

msgid "Yuri「get married.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Tiró 1500 yenes a la basura y aprovechó＿la oportunidad de casarse.」"

msgid "Yuri「On the other hand, I took the＿workshop seriously and overlooked＿that chance, fated never to encounter」"
msgstr "Yuri「En cambio, yo me tomé el taller en＿serio y dejé pasar esa oportunidad,＿condenada a no encontrar jamás」"

msgid "Yuri「the man of my dreams. I keep＿wondering if I made the right choice......」"
msgstr "Yuri「al hombre de mis sueños. Me＿pregunto si habré tomado la＿decisión correcta......」"
